<title>UK: Manders names Martin Allen finance chief.</title>
<headline>Manders names Martin Allen finance chief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Manders Plc said on Tuesday it named Martin Allen, an executive at Northern Foods Plc, as its new finance director, effective June 16.</p>
<p>Allen, who succeeds John Farmer, was previously finance director of dairy operations at Northern Foods, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Manders makes speciality coating and printing inks. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
